Z||000000||TRiAD||11-13-2001||02:00 PM||||...I never HEARD of a bent clutch pedal!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Whaddayathink? Bent enough for ya? NO IDEA how this car was ever in motion... hehe.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0MgAAAKERPrbnX8sC7MVcruABngQNz7kUpKGDvH2vMqSFTgSzOWA3j050PHOnws2mVHDE!YCZRsGwBEoiJXSVzw/Pedals.jpg">  <P><I>(and no, that's NOT the angle of the pic...it's THAT bent!)</I><P>Can't wait till my "Fiero Bob" pedal arrives...<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0RAAAAN8VWdTblRDE93zkbJ*AbWuOFSwE0rtNS2h23KCe3aGgj1O!JDqud!IoFt1NPvdq6rh9ef*226xJh!nSf*vv2Id5gL8WoDCkDX*tCeM/1985-Signature-2.gif">     <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B> ~ Photoshop rendition of planned modifications</I></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 11-13-2001).]||||reg||10
